  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\nLogic: **First Number = (Second Number × Third Number) ÷ 2**\n\n**(605, 110, 11)**\n\n→ 605 = (110 × 11) ÷ 2\n\n→ 605 = 1210 ÷ 2\n\n**(660, 40, 33) **\n\n→ 660 = (40 × 33) ÷ 2\n\n→ 660 = 1320 ÷ 2\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) (612, 180, 13)**\n\n→ 612 = (180 × 13) ÷ 2\n\n→ 612 ≠ 2340 ÷ 2 \n\n**2) (720, 120, 12) **\n\n→ 720 = (120 × 12) ÷ 2\n\n→ 720 = 1440 ÷ 2 ⇒ **Satisfies the logic.**\n\n**3) (519, 222, 11)**\n\n→ 519 = (222 × 11) ÷ 2\n\n→ 519 ≠ 2442 ÷ 2\n\n**4) (711, 188, 16)**\n\n→ 711 = (188 × 16) ÷ 2\n\n→ 711 ≠ 3008 ÷ 2\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 2 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****(720, 120, 12)\"**.",
